language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

capability MachineDiagnostics.
functionality ObserveMachineHistory.
functionality ServeMachineLabRequests.
functionality RouteMachineToolCommand.
functionality StopLabAutomation.

MachineLab cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/services/machine-lab/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
MachineLab provides MachineDiagnostics.
MachineLab owns ObserveMachineHistory.
ObserveMachineHistory realizes MachineDiagnostics.
ObserveMachineHistory specifies "Normal Machine v1 client; bounded history and optional ledger, independent of simulator/Bucking and non-authoritative.".
MachineLab owns ServeMachineLabRequests.
ServeMachineLabRequests realizes MachineDiagnostics.
ServeMachineLabRequests specifies "Correlated read/readbuf/status/checkpoint/artifact/replay requests and source-session-qualified cursors; exact Lab capability/scope checks.".
MachineLab owns RouteMachineToolCommand.
RouteMachineToolCommand realizes MachineDiagnostics.
RouteMachineToolCommand specifies "msctl semantic operator input uses public Machine ingress, not simulator wire injection; explicit grants permit control.".
MachineLab owns StopLabAutomation.
StopLabAutomation realizes MachineDiagnostics.
StopLabAutomation specifies "GlobalStop cancels configured automation but preserves observation/ledger; default observer-only is not a universal prohibition.".
